(7081900, 1077265, 19825, '<td valign="top">Yet another example of a Melethia image that gets a ho-hum overall average but really scores with folks with an eye for interesting work. The type of photographer I strive to become: one that can make a fascinating image out of an otherwise mundane scene. Lots of people can produce a pleasant image when sitting in the middle of a scenic vista at sunset, but only a few can create one in an empty corner of a Costco parking lot. Nice job.</td>', 'Yet another example of a Melethia image that gets a ho-hum overall average but really scores with folks with an eye for interesting work. The type of photographer I strive to become: one that can make a fascinating image out of an otherwise mundane scene. Lots of people can produce a pleasant image when sitting in the middle of a scenic vista at sunset, but only a few can create one in an empty corner of a Costco parking lot. Nice job.', '2013-08-05 13:51:38.000000', NULL, 0),
